 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Your obedience is known to everyone",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.29,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I rejoice over you in this light",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.36,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Be wise in what is good, dear friends",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.78,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And innocent in what is evil",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.84,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The God of peace will soon crush Satan",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.59,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Under your feet, the battle is won",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.43,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Grace of our Lord Jesus Christ",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.82,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Be with you now and forever",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.6,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Watch out for those who create divisions",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.87,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Put obstacles in your holy way",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.71,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They do not serve our Lord Christ",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.79,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But their own appetites instead",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.39,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The God of peace will soon crush Satan",
   "heard": 8,
